  "question": {
    "text": "Let \\(\\mathrm{A}=\\left[\\mathrm{a}_{i j}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}\\log _5 128 & \\log _4 5 \\\\ \\log _5 8 & \\log _4 25\\end{array}\\right]\\).\nIf \\(\\mathrm{A}_{i j}\\) is the cofactor of \\(\\mathrm{a}_{i j}, \\mathrm{C}_{i j}=\\sum_{\\mathrm{k}=1}^2 \\mathrm{a}_{i \\mathrm{k}} \\mathrm{A}_{j \\mathrm{k}}, 1 \\leq i, j \\leq 2\\), and \\(\\mathrm{C}=\\left[\\mathrm{C}_{i j}\\right]\\), then \\(8|\\mathrm{C}|\\) is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "9WoDO",
